{"page":487,"verses":[{"verse_key":"42:32","surah":42,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْ ءَايَـٰتِهِ ٱلْجَوَارِ فِى ٱلْبَحْرِ كَٱلْأَعْلَـٰمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Among His signs are the ships, sailing like floating mountains:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"And among","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"42:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"42:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْجَوَارِ","en_gloss":"(are) the ships","transliteration":"l-jawāri","verse_key":"42:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"42:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","en_gloss":"the sea","transliteration":"l-baḥri","verse_key":"42:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَٱلْأَعْلَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"like [the] mountains","transliteration":"kal-aʿlāmi","verse_key":"42:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:32"}]},{"verse_key":"42:33","surah":42,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"إِن يَشَأْ يُسْكِنِ ٱلرِّيحَ فَيَظْلَلْنَ رَوَاكِدَ عَلَىٰ ظَهْرِهِۦٓ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّكُلِّ صَبَّارٍ شَكُورٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"if He willed, He could bring the wind to a standstill and they would lie motionless on the surface of the sea- there truly are signs in this for anyone who is steadfast and thankful-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"42:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَشَأْ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yasha","verse_key":"42:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُسْكِنِ","en_gloss":"He can cause the wind to become still","transliteration":"yus'kini","verse_key":"42:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرِّيحَ","en_gloss":"He can cause the wind to become still","transliteration":"l-rīḥa","verse_key":"42:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَيَظْلَلْنَ","en_gloss":"then they would remain","transliteration":"fayaẓlalna","verse_key":"42:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَوَاكِدَ","en_gloss":"motionless","transliteration":"rawākida","verse_key":"42:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on